nary housewife, but..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c57128"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ad/addbaa5206fbd79f418eeb69eeb0349dae938eed4aa2aeec991362332e7ee479.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f8/f87c27afa10f3fcd9f5708946fff1674a0926df231288642e206b0fea005201c.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"飯田 空","creatorId":"vndb:s1450","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1450","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1450","name":"雨宮 侑布","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:21325","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c57141","characterName":"蓑輪 瞳子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c57141"},"originalCharacterName":"蓑輪 瞳子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"32"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"98"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"H"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"88"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"61"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has been married for 8 years and is a housewife."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a former designer and for a while she continued to work after marriage. Both her parents and in-laws kept asking when she is going to have a baby, she could not win against their nagging and gave birth to her first child, Koutarou."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her husband was very supportive in the beginning, but as the months went by, his enthusiasm cooled down, now he leaves all the household chores, including childcare, to her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She also believes that her husband is having an affair."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is not too pessimistic about the situation and says, \"Well, I don't care what I have to do, as long as he brings home some money for Koutarou. However, if Koutarou's happiness is threatened, she turns into a demon."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c57141"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3f/3f8d79ca5d6b74fb89dc968a857389c74d31c42a05491d019d0b5b19e9ed1870.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f1/f176f11ae0bb9805b1fcfbb14ab26123267b8e95d48f084500a70d81108f38ed.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c57151","characterName":"火村 杏","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c57151"},"originalCharacterName":"火村 杏","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"38"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"602"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"98"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"158"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"96"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"59"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"47"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her parents died early in life, and she has been the proprietress of a hot spring inn, Homura, since her twenties."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In front of Ippei and Ryouko, she speaks in an older sisterly manner. she can be a bit rough around the edges, but once in front of customers, she shows her perfect customer service with a calm and composed manner. She is also a karate expert, and even though he has retired from karate, he can still cut a beer bottle with her hand. So, although she could actually twist Tetsuji with one hand, she held back for fear that he might cause a serious injury to the young Ippei. Besides, she didn't want to raise her hand to a man she had fallen in love with."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"For whatever reason, she feels a little sad for Ippei, who has suddenly become withdrawn since he entered junior high school. She is also intensely frustrated by the lack of men in her life since her husband vanished ten years ago. Although she does not drown herself in it, she has a few adult toys hidden in the back of the mirror drawer."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her weakness is alcohol, and the mere smell of it makes her weak. On the day she accidentally drinks, her personality does a 180-degree turn and she becomes a crying baby."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c57151"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f4/f44ed55773ba24fb50e10b7eeb5c5e432390ae7ca1f850a06eef30b38174dcb9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e3/e3dcf084cb2452f28e758319596431d7637b5a0886c1cf341326029d7186a970.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"榎津 まお","creatorId":"vndb:s106","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s106","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s106","name":"野中 カオリ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:21315","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c57152","characterName":"音羽 了子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c57152"},"originalCharacterName":"音羽 了子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"32"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"324"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"90"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"151"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"93"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"58"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"45"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is Kyou's younger sister and your typical housewife."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She loves her husband Takenori, a chef, with all her heart. In contrast to her sister, she is calm and sociable. She is always worried that people around her might misunderstand her sister, who does not talk as much as she should, and she tries to take care of her in any way she can."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is also aware of her sister's loneliness now that she is on her own. Because of such careful consideration, Ippei was popular among the opposite sex. Therefore, although I am not as active as my older sister, I have had more sex than her. In this respect, she feels that her overly serious husband Takenori is a little lacking in some areas. Naturally, she doesn't usually show such things in public."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c57152"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2d/2d9f26a119c060e4fcc88bf7f143098658dbcf514a2e81d540a61360cd877494.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ee/eeba3ee8009ac66664cf2aad037b5bb720e0a88f42b22cd